      },
      "text": "# Explanation of period 2019-04-01 to 2019-11-05\n\n**Date:** 2026-02-13  \n**From:** Oskar Lindqvist, MD  \n**Application:** APP-2026-017  \n**Applicant:** Dr. Oskar Lindqvist, MD  \n**Period explained:** 2019-04-01 to 2019-11-05  \n\nI took seven months away from clinical practice to care for a parent after a stroke. I was not employed, not in training and not in the military during that period. I returned to full emergency department practice on 2019-11-06.\n\nOskar Lindqvist, MD"
    },
